From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:33:04 +0000
Subject: MIPS: intel-mips: build the xRX500 ethernet suite in grx500_defconfig

grx500_defconfig turned on neither CONFIG_NETDEVICES nor the driver
suite this platform exists for, so `make grx500_defconfig && make
vmlinux` compiled nothing at all under drivers/net/ethernet/lantiq/.
The in-tree defconfig therefore gave the series' largest body of new
code zero compile coverage: a warning introduced anywhere in the
ethernet suite could not be caught by building the platform's own
defconfig, which is exactly what happened during bring-up.

Enable the suite the way this target's OpenWrt overlay already does,
with CONFIG_INTEL_XRX500_NET=y and CONFIG_INTEL_XRX500_GSWIP_API=y.
That pulls in the whole intel-xrx500-gswip composite: the GSWIP-3.0
HAL, the datapath manager, the CBM, the HDMA driver, the TMU, the GPHY
firmware loader, the GSWIP MDIO bus and the netdev/phylink front end.
Nothing else has to be stated: CONFIG_ETHERNET is default y once
NETDEVICES is set, and the two Kconfig entries select the rest of what
the suite needs (MFD_SYSCON, REGMAP_MMIO and RESET_LANTIQ from
INTEL_XRX500_NET; PHYLIB, OF_MDIO, PHYLINK, FW_LOADER and
RESET_CONTROLLER from the HAL entry). The three added lines are
byte-identical to what savedefconfig emits for the resulting .config,
at the position it emits them.

This is inert for the image the port actually ships: OpenWrt builds
this target from its own kernel config, not from arch/mips/configs.
What it buys is that the defconfig now compiles the code it claims to
describe.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5
Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
index c81e5195923f..16d42b0acf2a 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/grx500_defconfig
@@ -76,6 +76,9 @@ CONFIG_ATM_BR2684=m
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_RAM=y
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_RAM_COUNT=4
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_RAM_SIZE=8192
+CONFIG_NETDEVICES=y
+CONFIG_INTEL_XRX500_NET=y
+CONFIG_INTEL_XRX500_GSWIP_API=y
 # CONFIG_INPUT_KEYBOARD is not set
 # CONFIG_INPUT_MOUSE is not set
 # CONFIG_SERIO is not set
